# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   A. Maevskiy et al. (2025). Predicting ionic conductivity in solids from the machine-learned potential energy landscape.
#   Physical Review Research. doi:10.1103/physrevresearch.7.023167  arXiv:2411.06804v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2411.06804v2 (sha256 b8e04ba27cb3ff9f...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
