# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/maevskiy2025.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the pretrained M3GNet (Materials Project) used for
# frozen-framework single-ion PES scans whose descriptors rank 1,302
# Materials Project Li compounds, and SevenNet used for MD validation of
# the top-ranked structures, with AIMD checks (SIESTA). Ranking scores,
# conductivities and diffusivities are not error metrics.

