###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The M3GNet model 'trained by the authors of the original work on the entire Materials Project dataset' is taken to be the registry model M3GNet-MPF-2021.2.8; SevenNet is a NequIP implementation.
# - Descriptor scores (truncated ROC areas), predicted conductivities and AIMD/SevenNet-MD diffusivities are not energy/force/stress errors.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
